OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to trace man with
OL,4,A'significant' head injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are trying to trace a man who
OL,7,Fleft Nottingham's Queen's Medical
OL,8,FCentre (QMC) with "significant" head
OL,9,Finjuries before treatment.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said a member of
OL,12,Fpublic came across the man at the
OL,13,FUniversity Boulevard junction of Jesse
OL,14,FBoot Avenue, on the border of the
OL,15,FUniversity Park Campus in Nottingham,
OL,16,Fat 22:30 BST on Saturday.
OL,18,FHe was taken to the QMC but left before
OL,19,Fbeing assessed, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
